# VoIP.ms API Credentials
VOIPMS_USERNAME='your-email@example.com'
VOIPMS_PASSWORD='your-api-password'

# Note: These credentials are used for:
# 1. Making API calls (required)
# 2. Downloading API documentation from website (optional)
#
# The VoIP.ms website may block automated access.
# If you need to update the HTML documentation:
# 1. Log in manually at https://voip.ms
# 2. Navigate to the API documentation
# 3. Save the page as 'VoIP.ms - API Documentation.html'
# 4. Place it in the resources/ directory